{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05873","headline":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 二 · 王维","name":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊居杜陵下，永日同携手。\n仁里霭川阳，平原见峰首。\n园庐鸣春鸠，林薄媚新柳。\n上卿始登席，故老前爲寿。\n临当游南陂，约略执桮酒。\n归欤绌微官，惆怅心自咎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}